  hex colors, and Montserrat font -- is unchanged. The five node icons are
  the one deliberate exception: swapped from the source design's own
  bespoke SVGs to the site's previous Tabler icon set for these stages
  (radar/coin/hammer/bolt/trending-up), per explicit request, so this
  trial keeps the design's layout/color system but our own icon language.
